            <p class="text-xs text-brand-secondary mb-6 leading-relaxed" data-ui="pilot_desc">Select your workflow parameters below to generate a structured project brief via Email or WhatsApp.</p>

            <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
