            addBullet('Localized daily current-affairs items for Pocket News, delivering approximately 200 pieces per week to a fixed publishing deadline.');
            addBullet('Adapted infographics into Hindi, restructuring dense exam material so it stayed readable within the visual layout.');
            addBullet('Researched and fact-checked source material against reliable sources, working with design and editorial teams to protect consistency and academic integrity.');

